{"overview":"سیلین، وکیل دفاعی بی‌رحم و قوانین‌پذیر، پدرش را به اشتباه زندانی کرده‌اند—برای او عدالت همیشه پیش از قانون می‌آید. ایلغاز، دادستانی که به‌صورت دقیق قوانین را دنبال می‌کند، معتقد است این دو چیز یکسان هستند. وقتی برادرش به قتل متهم می‌شود، او مجبور است به کمک او برود. ادامه داستان، یک هیجان‌انگیز تریلر قانونی است که بر پایه شیمی برتر دو طرف ساخته شده و برنده جایزه امی بین‌المللی بهترین تلنویلا در سال ۲۰۲۳ شد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Ceylin is a fierce, rule-bending defence attorney whose father was wrongly imprisoned — for her, justice always comes before the law. Ilgaz is a by-the-book prosecutor who believes the two are the same thing. When his brother is accused of murder, he has no choice but to go to her for help. What follows is a gripping cat-and-mouse legal thriller built on brilliant opposing chemistry — winner of the International Emmy for Best Telenovela in 2023.","tagline_en":"","runtime":139,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":34,"y":2021,"poster":"/foOao20RcWsCJOkNNA5xway8Sfq.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":29,"y":2022,"poster":"/foOao20RcWsCJOkNNA5xway8Sfq.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":32,"y":2023,"poster":"/foOao20RcWsCJOkNNA5xway8Sfq.jpg"}],"episodes":95,"crew":["Ali Bilgin","Sema Ergenekon"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["TR"],"cast":[{"name":"Kaan Urgancıoğlu","role":"Ilgaz Kaya","photo":"/oWYb9CAkBLh0ojzsO3OySduVjpM.jpg"},{"name":"Pınar Deniz","role":"Ceylin Erguvan","photo":"/zZj5nq9dP3otwFBmEgvSHiBaNqO.jpg"},{"name":"Uğur Polat","role":"Yekta Tilmen","photo":"/gjlBUlvNtdtevadu1CI5F8sJNhs.jpg"},{"name":"Zeyno Eracar","role":"Gül Erguvan","photo":"/iq5YvCCM7mZPYCq6CSdspXAMe5a.jpg"},{"name":"Uğur Aslan","role":"Eren Duman","photo":"/kcTO3E60pdG2ofCkfPkI809IebE.jpg"},{"name":"Arda Anarat","role":"Çınar Kaya","photo":"/mKyFub7hO45PDHVYXpW2JkYeyNF.jpg"},{"name":"Zeynep Atılgan","role":"Parla Yılmaz","photo":"/psBTBD2ewcU0XufZ5o395ikkNJe.jpg"},{"name":"Pınar Çağlar Gençtürk","role":"Aylin Erguvan Yılmaz","photo":"/iM